" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmUzQkkOLZgaAFutVywUu8NuKPiajnfkiaojQoUkuTwTKkeVZxxgBVxByw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmTMpeGkzu68V8ib3KHzOLiaWJKyicNyO49FEEHEJsVF9ZcqGX8UicpFNLlA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>      上海海洋大学海洋生物资源与管理学院（以下简称海资学院）是国家“双一流”水产学科的重要支撑学院。2017年和2022年学科评估中，水产学科为A+等级。2019年，海洋渔业科学与技术专业入选首批国家级一流本科专业建设点。</span></p><p><span>      以2025年中国远洋渔业发展四十年为契机，进一步促进海洋类高校之间的交流，增强相互了解，激发对专业课程学习、研究兴趣，进一步关心海洋、认识海洋、经略海洋，鼓励广大学生积极投身海洋强国建设。海资学院决定举办“海资学院2025年大学生夏令营活动”。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>一、活动主题</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>“瀚海扬帆四十载，耕波牧渔向深蓝”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>           ——献礼中国远洋渔业发展四十年</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>活动时间</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年6月16-20日，报名阶段。</span></p><p><span>2025年6月24日前，确定并公布夏令营入营名单。</span></p><p><span>2025年7月3-5日，举办线下夏令营活动。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>招收对象</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>中国海洋大学、广东海洋大学、浙江海洋大学、江苏海洋大学、天津农学院、上海海洋大学，水产、海洋等相关专业23级本科生（大二学生）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>活动人数</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>每所高校推荐5名学生参加，全体参营人数为30人。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>活动内容</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院将举办知名学者学术报告、师生交流、实地考察等活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、申请条件及办法</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>申请条件</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.坚持党的基本路线和基本理论，具有优良的政治素质和高尚的品行修养；遵守国家法律、法规和学校的各项规章制度，诚实守信，无违法违纪行为，未受任何处分。</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优良，对水产和海洋学科领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强科研潜力。</span></p><p><span>3.身心健康。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>申请方式与流程</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>所在高校相关学院自行组织申报推荐，6月24日前提交《推荐名单汇总表》（附件一），并审核盖章。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>四、学院提供支持</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nyfYuaesG1weQPZarVqiaRbWYeBMPwTdmlU6xa81AvDqZEPJdibGW5M12Yv0qjI2ECUVFEInW7ibCmdlOXVWjmOibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>后勤保障</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>海资学院为参营营员提供食宿安排，并购买夏令营活动期间人身意外伤害保险。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>交通补贴</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>非上海高校，所在地至上海海洋大学的省际、市内往返交通费用按照每人1000元的标准进行补贴。夏令营活动期间的交通，学校统一安排车辆。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>夏令营结业证书颁发</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>根据参加情况，并提供不少于1500字参营小结，颁发结业证书。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>上海海洋大学海资学院联系人：张宜振</span></p><p><span>联系方式：13262509916</span></p><p><span>邮箱：yzzhang@shou.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海海洋大学海洋生物资源与管理学院</span></p><p><span>2025年6月16日</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/W7hQeZmjTWSFV0K3SuRXsw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件一：海资学院2025年夏令营活动推荐名单汇总表.docx</a></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><se